---
const topics = [
  {
    number: "01",
    name: "Business",
    description: "Companies, money, markets, strategy, and why businesses work the way they do.",
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    name: "Technology",
    description: "Software, fintech, platforms, infrastructure, devices, and the technologies changing how people work.",
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    name: "Startups",
    description: "New companies, funding, growth, failure, acquisitions, and the choices early teams make.",
  },
  {
    number: "04",
    name: "AI",
    description: "Models, products, adoption, economics, policy, and what AI changes for companies and workers.",
  },
  {
    number: "05",
    name: "Building",
    description: "Product, sales, distribution, pricing, hiring, operations, and the work of making something real.",
  },
] as const;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="About Portfilo, a publication covering business and tech from the Philippines."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f4f0e8" />
    <title>About | Portfilo</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a>

    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Portfilo home">
        <span class="wordmark__inner">
          <span class="wordmark__port">Port</span><span class="wordmark__fi">fi</span><span class="wordmark__lo">lo</span>
        </span>
      </a>
      <p class="site-header__strapline">
        Business and tech, from the Philippines.
      </p>
      <p class="site-header__section">About</p>
    </header>

    <main id="main-content" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="about-hero" aria-labelledby="about-title">
        <p class="about-kicker">About Portfilo</p>

        <h1 id="about-title">
          You shouldn't need an insider network to follow business and tech.
        </h1>

        <p class="about-intro">
          Portfilo covers companies, startups, AI, markets, and the work of building.
          Some stories are Philippine. Others are global and matter here anyway.
        </p>

        <div class="about-positioning" aria-label="Portfilo positioning">
          <span>Portfilo</span>
          <strong>Business and tech, from the Philippines.</strong>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section" aria-labelledby="work-title">
        <header class="section-head">
          <p>01 / What we do</p>
          <p>Coverage</p>
        </header>

        <div class="section-layout">
          <div class="section-title">
            <h2 id="work-title">We follow the story past the announcement.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="section-copy">
            <p>
              Launches, funding rounds, product claims, policy changes, and market
              numbers are starting points. We want to know what changed, who it
              affects, and what still is not clear.
            </p>
            <p>
              Some stories explain a company or market. Others unpack a technology,
              a business decision, or the work behind building something. The format
              follows the question.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <ol class="topic-list" aria-label="Portfilo coverage areas">
          {
            topics.map((topic) => (
              <li>
                <p class="topic-list__number">{topic.number}</p>
                <h3>{topic.name}</h3>
                <p>{topic.description}</p>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="reader-section" aria-labelledby="reader-title">
        <div class="reader-section__inner">
          <p class="reader-section__index">02 / Who it is for</p>

          <div class="reader-section__statement">
            <h2 id="reader-title">
              You don't need to already know the room.
            </h2>
            <p>
              Portfilo is for people getting into business and tech, already working
              in it, or simply trying to understand how it works. You do not need a
              founder title, finance degree, or insider network to follow along.
            </p>
          </div>

          <aside class="reader-section__note" aria-label="Audience note">
            <p>Reader note</p>
            <strong>If a term matters, we explain it.</strong>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section context-section" aria-labelledby="context-title">
        <header class="section-head">
          <p>03 / Philippine context</p>
          <p>Why place matters</p>
        </header>

        <div class="section-layout">
          <div class="section-title">
            <h2 id="context-title">A global story can land differently here.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="section-copy">
            <p>
              Prices, regulation, infrastructure, payments, labor, financing,
              geography, and consumer behavior can change what a global business or
              technology story means in the Philippines.
            </p>
            <p>
              We use local context when it changes the story. We leave it out when it
              does not.
            </p>
          </div>

          <aside class="context-note" aria-label="Context questions">
            <p>What matters</p>
            <ul>
              <li>What changes here?</li>
              <li>What stays true?</li>
              <li>What should the reader know?</li>
            </ul>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="about-section standards-bridge" aria-labelledby="standards-title">
        <header class="section-head">
          <p>04 / How we work</p>
          <p>Research & Standards</p>
        </header>

        <div class="standards-bridge__layout">
          <div>
            <h2 id="standards-title">The conclusion comes after the reporting.</h2>
          </div>

          <div class="standards-bridge__copy">
            <p>
              We go to primary sources when they are available, check consequential
              claims, keep important uncertainty in the story, and correct material
              errors visibly. AI can help with the work, but it cannot establish a fact.
            </p>
            <a href="/standards">
              Read our standards <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="founder-note" aria-label="Founder">
        <p>Founder</p>
        <strong>Louda Tuppal</strong>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="site-footer__brand" aria-label="Portfilo">
        <span class="site-footer__port">Port</span><span class="site-footer__fi">fi</span><span class="site-footer__lo">lo</span>
      </div>
      <p>Portfilo / Philippines</p>
      <a href="/">Back to home</a>
    </footer>

    <style>
      @font-face {
        font-family: "Instrument Sans";
        font-style: normal;
        font-display: swap;
        font-weight: 400 700;
        src: url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/instrument-sans:vf@5.3.0/latin-wght-normal.woff2")
          format("woff2-variations");
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "Source Serif 4";
        font-style: normal;
        font-display: swap;
        font-weight: 200 900;
        src: url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/source-serif-4:vf@5.3.0/latin-wght-normal.woff2")
          format("woff2-variations");
      }

      @font-face {
        font-family: "IBM Plex Mono";
        font-style: normal;
        font-display: swap;
        font-weight: 400;
        src: url("https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/fontsource/fonts/ibm-plex-mono@5.3.0/latin-400-normal.woff2")
          format("woff2");
      }

      :global(:root) {
        --paper: #f4f0e8;
        --ink: #171614;
        --muted: #69655e;
        --line: #cbc5bb;
        --accent: #0050a4;
        --accent-on-ink: #8fc7ff;
        --correction: #b42318;
        --page-max: 100rem;
        --gutter: clamp(1.25rem, 3.3vw, 3.75rem);
        --grid-gap: clamp(0.8rem, 1.6vw, 1.5rem);
        --sans: "Instrument Sans", "Helvetica Neue", Arial, sans-serif;
        --serif: "Source Serif 4", Georgia, serif;
        --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      }

      :global(*) {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      :global(html) {
        background: var(--paper);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: var(--sans);
        font-synthesis: none;
      }

      :global(body) {
        margin: 0;
        min-width: 0;
        background: var(--paper);
      }

      :global(a) {
        color: inherit;
      }

      :global(a:focus-visible) {
        outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
        outline-offset: 4px;
      }

      :global(#main-content:focus) {
        outline: none;
      }

      .skip-link {
        position: fixed;
        z-index: 20;
        top: 0.75rem;
        left: 0.75rem;
        padding: 0.65rem 0.8rem;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--paper);
        font: 400 0.75rem/1 var(--mono);
        text-decoration: none;
        transform: translateY(-200%);
      }

      .skip-link:focus {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }

      .site-header,
      .about-hero,
      .about-section,
      .reader-section__inner,
      .founder-note,
      .site-footer {
        width: min(100%, var(--page-max));
        margin-inline: auto;
      }

      .site-header {
        padding: 1.05rem var(--gutter) 0.95rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 3fr 6fr 3fr;
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        align-items: end;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
      }

      .wordmark {
        width: fit-content;
        display: inline-block;
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .wordmark__inner {
        display: inline-block;
        white-space: nowrap;
        font: 700 clamp(1.75rem, 2.2vw, 2.3rem) / 0.9 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.085em;
        transform: skewX(-12deg);
        transform-origin: left center;
      }

      .wordmark__port,
      .wordmark__fi,
      .wordmark__lo,
      .site-footer__port,
      .site-footer__fi,
      .site-footer__lo {
        display: inline-block;
      }

      .wordmark__port,
      .site-footer__port {
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .wordmark__fi,
      .site-footer__fi {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .wordmark__lo,
      .site-footer__lo {
        color: var(--correction);
      }

      .site-header__strapline,
      .site-header__section {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font: 400 0.68rem/1.35 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .site-header__strapline {
        text-align: center;
      }

      .site-header__section {
        color: var(--ink);
        text-align: right;
      }

      .about-hero {
        padding: clamp(3.8rem, 7vw, 7.5rem) var(--gutter)
          clamp(5rem, 9vw, 9rem);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        column-gap: var(--grid-gap);
        row-gap: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 4rem);
      }

      .about-kicker {
        grid-column: 1 / 4;
        margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
        color: var(--accent);
        font: 400 0.67rem/1.4 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.09em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .about-hero h1 {
        grid-column: 3 / 13;
        min-width: 0;
        max-width: 15ch;
        margin: 0;
        font: 500 clamp(3.7rem, 7.4vw, 7.7rem) / 0.9 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.067em;
        text-wrap: balance;
        overflow-wrap: break-word;
      }

      .about-intro {
        grid-column: 5 / 11;
        max-width: 43rem;
        margin: 0;
        font: 400 clamp(1.28rem, 1.7vw, 1.68rem) / 1.5 var(--serif);
      }

      .about-positioning {
        grid-column: 1 / 4;
        align-self: end;
        padding-top: 0.85rem;
        border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
        font: 400 0.67rem/1.55 var(--mono);
      }

      .about-positioning span {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .about-positioning strong {
        display: block;
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .about-section {
        padding-inline: var(--gutter);
      }

      .section-head {
        padding: 0.72rem 0 0.65rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        color: var(--muted);
        font: 400 0.64rem/1.4 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.09em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .section-head p {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .section-head p:first-child {
        grid-column: 1 / 5;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .section-head p:last-child {
        grid-column: 9 / 13;
        text-align: right;
      }

      .section-layout {
        padding: clamp(3.2rem, 6vw, 6.5rem) 0 clamp(4rem, 7vw, 7rem);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
      }

      .section-title {
        grid-column: 1 / 6;
      }

      .section-title h2,
      .standards-bridge h2 {
        max-width: 13ch;
        margin: 0;
        font: 500 clamp(2.75rem, 4.8vw, 5rem) / 0.95 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.057em;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }

      .section-copy {
        grid-column: 7 / 11;
        max-width: 39rem;
        font: 400 clamp(1.12rem, 1.35vw, 1.3rem) / 1.67 var(--serif);
      }

      .section-copy p {
        margin: 0 0 1.35em;
      }

      .section-copy p:last-child {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .topic-list {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0 0 clamp(5rem, 8vw, 8rem);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr));
        list-style: none;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
      }

      .topic-list li {
        min-width: 0;
        min-height: 17rem;
        padding: 0.9rem 1rem 1.25rem;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .topic-list li:last-child {
        border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .topic-list__number {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--accent);
        font: 400 0.63rem/1.35 var(--mono);
      }

      .topic-list h3 {
        margin: auto 0 0.85rem;
        font: 500 clamp(1.65rem, 2.1vw, 2.15rem) / 1 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      }

      .topic-list li > p:last-child {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font: 400 0.92rem/1.5 var(--serif);
      }

      .reader-section {
        width: 100%;
        background: var(--ink);
        color: var(--paper);
      }

      .reader-section__inner {
        padding: clamp(4.5rem, 8vw, 8rem) var(--gutter);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
      }

      .reader-section__index {
        grid-column: 1 / 3;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--accent-on-ink);
        font: 400 0.64rem/1.4 var(--mono);
        letter-spacing: 0.09em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .reader-section__statement {
        grid-column: 4 / 10;
      }

      .reader-section h2 {
        max-width: 14ch;
        margin: 0;
        font: 500 clamp(3rem, 5.3vw, 5.5rem) / 0.94 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.06em;
        text-wrap: balance;
      }

      .reader-section__statement > p {
        max-width: 42rem;
        margin: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.5rem) 0 0;
        color: #d7d2c9;
        font: 400 clamp(1.15rem, 1.45vw, 1.4rem) / 1.58 var(--serif);
      }

      .reader-section__note {
        grid-column: 11 / 13;
        align-self: end;
        padding-top: 0.8rem;
        border-top: 3px solid var(--accent-on-ink);
        font: 400 0.66rem/1.5 var(--mono);
      }

      .reader-section__note p {
        margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
        color: #bdb8af;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .reader-section__note strong {
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .context-note {
        grid-column: 11 / 13;
        align-self: start;
        padding-top: 0.8rem;
        border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
        font: 400 0.67rem/1.55 var(--mono);
      }

      .context-note > p {
        margin: 0 0 0.7rem;
        color: var(--muted);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .context-note ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        list-style: none;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .context-note li {
        padding: 0.65rem 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      }

      .standards-bridge {
        padding-top: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem);
      }

      .standards-bridge__layout {
        padding: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 6.5rem) 0 clamp(5rem, 8vw, 8rem);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
      }

      .standards-bridge__layout > div:first-child {
        grid-column: 1 / 6;
      }

      .standards-bridge__copy {
        grid-column: 7 / 12;
      }

      .standards-bridge__copy p {
        max-width: 40rem;
        margin: 0;
        font: 400 clamp(1.15rem, 1.45vw, 1.38rem) / 1.64 var(--serif);
      }

      .standards-bridge__copy a {
        width: fit-content;
        margin-top: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 3rem);
        padding: 0.85rem 0 0.7rem;
        display: block;
        border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
        font: 500 clamp(1.05rem, 1.4vw, 1.25rem) / 1.2 var(--sans);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .standards-bridge__copy a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .standards-bridge__copy a span {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .founder-note {
        padding: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.5rem) var(--gutter);
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 2fr 10fr;
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        align-items: baseline;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--ink);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink);
        font: 400 0.68rem/1.55 var(--mono);
      }

      .founder-note p,
      .founder-note strong {
        margin: 0;
      }

      .founder-note p {
        color: var(--muted);
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .founder-note strong {
        font-weight: 400;
      }

      .site-footer {
        padding: 1.2rem var(--gutter) 1.4rem;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 3fr 6fr 3fr;
        gap: var(--grid-gap);
        align-items: end;
        font: 400 0.64rem/1.45 var(--mono);
      }

      .site-footer__brand {
        width: fit-content;
        white-space: nowrap;
        font: 700 1.55rem/0.9 var(--sans);
        letter-spacing: -0.085em;
        transform: skewX(-12deg);
        transform-origin: left center;
      }

      .site-footer p {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        text-align: center;
        letter-spacing: 0.06em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .site-footer a {
        justify-self: end;
        text-decoration-color: var(--accent);
        text-decoration-thickness: 0.1em;
        text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
      }

      .site-footer a:hover {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      @media (max-width: 64rem) {
        .about-hero h1 {
          grid-column: 2 / 13;
        }

        .about-intro {
          grid-column: 4 / 11;
        }

        .section-title {
          grid-column: 1 / 6;
        }

        .section-copy {
          grid-column: 6 / 10;
        }

        .context-note {
          grid-column: 10 / 13;
        }

        .reader-section__statement {
          grid-column: 3 / 10;
        }

        .reader-section__note {
          grid-column: 10 / 13;
        }

        .standards-bridge__layout > div:first-child {
          grid-column: 1 / 6;
        }

        .standards-bridge__copy {
          grid-column: 6 / 12;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 50rem) {
        .site-header {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
          align-items: center;
          padding-top: 0.9rem;
        }

        .site-header__strapline {
          grid-column: 1 / -1;
          grid-row: 2;
          max-width: 32rem;
          padding-top: 0.55rem;
          text-align: left;
        }

        .site-header__section {
          grid-column: 2;
          grid-row: 1;
        }

        .about-hero {
          display: block;
          padding-top: 3.6rem;
          padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
        }

        .about-kicker {
          margin: 0 0 1.35rem;
        }

        .about-hero h1 {
          max-width: none;
          font-size: clamp(3.05rem, 12.7vw, 4.7rem);
          line-height: 0.93;
          text-wrap: pretty;
        }

        .about-intro {
          max-width: 36rem;
          margin-top: 2.2rem;
          font-size: 1.25rem;
        }

        .about-positioning {
          max-width: 25rem;
          margin-top: 3rem;
        }

        .section-head {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
          gap: 1rem;
        }

        .section-head p:first-child,
        .section-head p:last-child {
          grid-column: auto;
        }

        .section-layout,
        .standards-bridge__layout {
          display: block;
          padding-top: 2.8rem;
          padding-bottom: 4rem;
        }

        .section-title h2,
        .standards-bridge h2 {
          max-width: 15ch;
          font-size: clamp(2.55rem, 10vw, 3.8rem);
        }

        .section-copy,
        .standards-bridge__copy {
          max-width: 37rem;
          margin-top: 2rem;
          font-size: 1.14rem;
        }

        .topic-list {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
          padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
        }

        .topic-list li {
          min-height: 14rem;
          border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        }

        .topic-list li:nth-child(odd) {
          border-left: 0;
        }

        .topic-list li:last-child {
          grid-column: 1 / -1;
          min-height: 11rem;
          border-right: 0;
        }

        .reader-section__inner {
          display: block;
          padding-top: 4rem;
          padding-bottom: 4.5rem;
        }

        .reader-section__index {
          margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .reader-section h2 {
          max-width: 15ch;
          font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 11vw, 4.2rem);
        }

        .reader-section__statement > p {
          margin-top: 2rem;
          font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

